<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Instrumentation Laboratory S.P.A..</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Instrumentation Laboratory S.P.A..</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Instrumentation Laboratory S.P.A.</p>
<p>Nasdaq Stock symbol	     ILABY</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $15-$17/shr</p>
<p>Total ADS * to be offered	5,364,889</p>
<p>Total U.S. ADS to be offered  1,875,000</p>
<p>Total International offered   1,250,000</p>
<p>Offered by U.S. shareholders  1,343,933</p>
<p>Offered by International	   895,956</p>
<p>Outstanding after ipo #	16,609,500</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Salomon Bros Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  804,733 ADS</p>
<p>Business: developer, manufacturer and distributor of in vitro diagnostics instruments and related reagents, controls, other consumables and services for use primarily in hospitals and independent clinical trials.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: repay subordinated loans and borrowings under the short-term credit lines.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s -   Not Available</p>
<p>* - American Depositary Shares</p>
<p># - Ordinary Shares</p>
